'''Zealots''' are a type of {{MobSprite|Enderman}} found exclusively in the {{zone|Dragon's Nest}}. 

== Spawning ==
'''Zealots''' spawn in predetermined locations in the {{zone|Dragon's Nest}}. A wave of 16 Zealots spawns every 11 seconds, except in the period between the death of an {{MobSprite|Ender Dragon}} and the respawning of the [[Dragon Egg]]. Spawned Zealots have a {{Chance|2%|1|50}} chance to spawn holding an Ender Chest. These Zealots drop additional loot upon being killed.

